UID:fri-12@necronomicon-2026.todb
DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T133000Z
DTEND:20260814T150000Z
SUMMARY:🔵 Author Readings
LOCATION:11 Dorrance Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Readings by Michelle Renee Lane\, Nate Pedersen\, Peter Rawlik
 \, and Matthew Spencer. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/m
 ain/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#fri-12
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-12
