DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T133000Z
DTEND:20260814T150000Z
SUMMARY:🔵 WORKSHOP: Improving Your Skills as a Moderator
LOCATION:11 Dorrance Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Moderators can make or break a panel. This interactive worksho
 p explores planning\, organizing\, and running a panel: how to engage pan
 elists\, keep things on track\, share the microphone\, and handle disagre
 ement. Led by Trisha J. Wooldridge and K. H. Vaughan. Full listing: https
 ://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#f
 ri-13
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-13
