SUMMARY:🟢 Walking Tour (Donovan Loucks)
LOCATION:Check the convention's Walking Tour page for the current meet-up 
 spot
DESCRIPTION:A guided walking tour of Lovecraft-related sites around Provid
 ence\, led by Donovan Loucks. Requires a separate $15 ticket\; meeting po
 int and details are on the convention's Walking Tour page. Full listing: 
 https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README
 .md#fri-14
