DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T150000Z
DTEND:20260814T220000Z
SUMMARY:🟢 Vendor Hall / Grand Emporium of the Weird
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Over 60 vendors set up shop in the Omni's Narragansett Ballroo
 m\, selling weird-fiction books\, art\, oddities\, and convention merchan
 dise. Opens early at 10:00a for Golden/Silver Key holders\; general admis
 sion begins 11:00a. Requires a convention pass. Full listing: https://git
 hub.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#fri-15
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-15
