UID:fri-16@necronomicon-2026.todb
DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T150000Z
DTEND:20260814T160000Z
SUMMARY:🟢 Voices in the Dark – A Short Exploration of (Ghost) Stories
LOCATION:95 Empire Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:A ghost-story performance set in the hills of Wales\, where La
 vinia Ravenwood trades strange stories with the audience while attempting
  to uncover the truth of a manor haunted by Randolph Carter. The premiere
  of "Voices in the Dark\," a Key of Dreams production by JD Henshaw and H
 eather-Rose Andrews\; repeats Sunday afternoon. $10 covers the whole day 
 of AS220 theatrical events. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/bl
 ob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#fri-16
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-16
END:VEVENT
