UID:fri-17@necronomicon-2026.todb
DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T150000Z
DTEND:20260814T163000Z
SUMMARY:🟣 Armitage Session 2: Transcendence and Transgressions in Mytho
 s-making
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Academic paper session chaired by Eddie Guimont. Papers: Byron
  Nakamura\, "A Shared Bond through Greece and Rome: Classical References 
 in the Letters of HP Lovecraft and Frank Belknap Long"\; Sean Moreland\, 
 "Animi Terrores: The Lucretian Roots of Cosmic Horror and Folk Horror"\; 
 Luke Matthews\, "Lovecraft's Influence on UFO/UAP Ontologies"\; Eric Will
 iams\, "Two-Fisted Horror: Baring-Gould's Grettir the Outlaw and its infl
 uence on Robert E. Howard." Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/bl
 ob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#fri-17
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-17
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fri-18@necronomicon-2026.todb
DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T150000Z
DTEND:20260814T163000Z
SUMMARY:🔵 In Mountains Older than Bones: Appalachian Gothic
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:On America's cultural map\, Appalachia is the equivalent of "H
 ere there be monsters." Panelists discuss what defines Appalachian Gothic
 \, good and bad examples of the genre\, and why the region has such a hol
 d on the popular imagination. Panelists: Mike Allen (Moderator)\, Luke Do
 dd\, Tonya Monteforte\, Shanna Germain\, Stephen Mark Rainey. Full listin
 g: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-18
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-18
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fri-19@necronomicon-2026.todb
DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T150000Z
DTEND:20260814T163000Z
SUMMARY:🔵 Arthur Machen: A Weird Life
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Arthur Machen came first on Lovecraft's list of "masters of co
 smic horror." The panel explores the breadth of his writing in the contex
 t of his changing fortunes and strange encounters\, from Wales to Bohemia
 n London and the Hermetic Order of the Golden Dawn. Presented by the Arth
 ur Machen Society. Panelists: Dean W Zimmerman (Moderator)\, Timothy J Ja
 rvis\, Melissa Stewart\, Eric Steinhart\, Aaron Worth. Full listing: http
 s://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#
 fri-19
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-19
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fri-20@necronomicon-2026.todb
DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T150000Z
DTEND:20260814T163000Z
SUMMARY:🔵 Religion in The Call of Cthulhu RPGs
LOCATION:11 Dorrance Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Call of Cthulhu incorporates real-world faiths\, necessitating
  a balance between Mythos flavor and evolving cultural sensibilities. Pan
 elists discuss notable appearances of real faiths in CoC and offer advice
  to Keepers on respectfully incorporating them. Panelists: Peter Bebergal
 \, J F Martel\, Mike Mason. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/bl
 ob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#fri-20
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-20
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fri-21@necronomicon-2026.todb
DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T150000Z
DTEND:20260814T163000Z
SUMMARY:🔵 That Abandoned Mall is Still Playing Music: Theory and Histor
 y of Hauntology
LOCATION:11 Dorrance Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:"Hauntology" generally refers to the persistence of the ghosts
  of a possible future that did not come — from an abandoned home's deca
 ying Christmas gifts to a city scarred by war. Panelists discuss left-beh
 ind futures in architecture\, language\, art\, and social structures. Pan
 elists: Gillian Daniels (Moderator)\, Gabriel Mesa\, Allen B. Ruch\, Matt
 hew Spencer\, Sonya Taaffe\, Jeff VanderMeer. Full listing: https://githu
 b.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#fri-21
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-21
END:VEVENT
