UID:fri-22@necronomicon-2026.todb
DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T150000Z
DTEND:20260814T163000Z
SUMMARY:🔵 SPECIAL PRESENTATION: Masters of Monsters — The Tradition o
 f Horror in Japanese Folklore and Manga
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:From the ancient weird energy of mononoke to the rise of yokai
  in the Edo period\, Japanese storytellers have a well of frights to draw
  on. Presented by renowned folklorist Zack Davisson\, author of The Ultim
 ate Guide to Japanese Yokai. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/b
 lob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#fri-22
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-22
END:VEVENT
