SUMMARY:🔵 Author Readings
LOCATION:11 Dorrance Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Readings by John Langan\, Laura Langrish\, Zin E. Rocklyn\, an
 d Jason A. Wyckoff. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/
 lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#fri-23
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-23
