SUMMARY:🔵 WORKSHOP: Improving Your Skills as a Panelist
LOCATION:11 Dorrance Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:An interactive workshop on what makes for an entertaining\, in
 formative\, memorable panelist: preparation\, negotiating topics\, mic et
 iquette\, and the Deadly Sins to avoid. Led by Trisha J. Wooldridge and K
 . H. Vaughan. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecr
 aft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#fri-24
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-24
