DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T160000Z
DTEND:20260814T210000Z
SUMMARY:🟢 Ars Necronomica: A Call into the Abyss (Art Exhibition)
LOCATION:95 Empire Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:A three-week group art exhibition featuring over 20 artists wo
 rking in weird and cosmic-horror-inspired art\, open across multiple conv
 ention days. Free and open to the public. Full listing: https://github.co
 m/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#fri-25
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-25
