DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T161500Z
DTEND:20260814T171500Z
SUMMARY:🟢 Thomas Ligotti's "The Bungalow House"
LOCATION:95 Empire Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:A rare live performance of Ligotti's unsettling story\, featur
 ing voice actor Jon Padgett's narration alongside musician Chris Bozzone'
 s live scoring\, building an atmosphere of mounting dread as the protagon
 ist searches for release from a heartbreaking sadness. Full listing: http
 s://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#
 fri-26
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-26
