UID:fri-27@necronomicon-2026.todb
DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T163000Z
DTEND:20260814T174500Z
SUMMARY:🟢 Meet the Cast of Dark Providence!
LOCATION:11 Dorrance Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:A lunchtime panel and meet-and-greet with the cast of the live
  audio drama "Dark Providence\," which first premiered at NecronomiCon a 
 decade ago. Bring your lunch and chat with creators Patrick Hayle\, Clark
  Huggins\, and Zuzanna Szadkowski (Gossip Girl\, The Knick)\, plus other 
 performers and producers. The full live performance is staged separately 
 at the Black Box Theater\, Friday at 4:00p or Saturday at 6:00p. Full lis
 ting: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/
 README.md#fri-27
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-27
