UID:fri-28@necronomicon-2026.todb
DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T163000Z
DTEND:20260814T180000Z
SUMMARY:🟠 Strange Magick (Documentary)
LOCATION:20 Washington Place\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Bill Darmon\, this documentary follows occultist A
 leister Crowley and H. P. Lovecraft in World War I-era New Hampshire\, un
 covering hidden connections between esoteric magic and historical espiona
 ge. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necron
 omicon-2026/README.md#fri-28
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-28
