UID:fri-29@necronomicon-2026.todb
DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T180000Z
DTEND:20260814T190000Z
SUMMARY:🟢 TL Wiswell's The Magic Lantern "Call of Cthulhu"
LOCATION:95 Empire Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:At a meeting of the Boston Theosophical Brotherhood\, esoteric
  traveller Miranda Carter shares her theory about the ghost ship Alert\, 
 including an undeveloped bit of film shown live on stage for the first ti
 me ever. TL Wiswell brings "Call of Cthulhu" to life using an antique-sty
 le magic lantern with hand-painted glass plates. Full listing: https://gi
 thub.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#fri-29
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-29
