UID:fri-30@necronomicon-2026.todb
DTSTAMP:20260814T140220Z
DTSTART:20260814T180000Z
DTEND:20260814T193000Z
SUMMARY:🟣 Invited Academic Speakers 1
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Allison Horrocks\, "Walking the Line: Spiritualism and Public 
 History\," on what distinguishes a cemetery tour from a séance and how h
 istorians' methods differ from mediums'. Stefani Koorey\, "Forty Whacks a
 nd Due Process: How Massachusetts Law Made and Unmade the Case Against Li
 zzie Borden\," on the procedural path of the Borden case and what happens
  when the law formally acquits someone a community has already convicted.
  Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomi
 con-2026/README.md#fri-30
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#fri-30
