 ocalyptic Dark Ages in Weird Fiction
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:An exploration of works about people living generations after 
 industrial civilization's collapse\, from Thundarr the Barbarian and Gamm
 a World to Canticle for Leibowitz and The Road. Panelists: Curtis M. Laws
 on (Moderator)\, F. Brett Cox\, Larissa Glasser\, Jacy Morris\, Douglas E
  Winter. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/n
