SUMMARY:🔵 Poe and Whitman in Providence
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Between 1845 and 1848\, Poe visited Providence\, culminating i
 n his courtship of poet Sarah Helen Whitman. Panelists discuss his time h
 ere\, the effect on their lives and work\, and Whitman's role in preservi
 ng his legacy. Panelists: John Langan (Moderator)\, Chad Anctil\, Christa
  Carmen\, Joshua Rex\, Meg Smith. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/t
 odb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#fri-32
