SUMMARY:🔵 The Horror and Weird Fiction of Ray Bradbury
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:From Dark Carnival to Something Wicked This Way Comes\, paneli
 sts discuss how Bradbury could go from whimsical elsewhere to cruel and u
 nsettling in his horror\, and how his vision compares to cosmic horror au
 thors. Panelists: Jason A. Wyckoff (Moderator)\, Maurice Broaddus\, Jeffr
 ey Ford\, T.E. Grau\, Thomas Olivieri. Full listing: https://github.com/t
 odb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#fri-33
