 ction
LOCATION:11 Dorrance Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Nabokov is famous for Lolita and Pale Fire — but is his work
  weird? Panelists describe how\, beneath the surface\, it's pervaded with
  hints of the otherworldly and strange. Panelists: John WM Thompson (Mode
 rator)\, Jeff VanderMeer\, Alison Lanier\, Sean Moreland\, Derek Austin J
 ohnson. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/ne
 cronomicon-2026/README.md#fri-34
