 ans in how they think\, feel\, and perceive. Panelists reveal ways to bri
 ng alien psychology and motivations to life. Panelists: Sarah T Walker (M
 oderator)\, Linda D. Addison\, Phil Gelatt\, Fred Van Lente\, Rick Claypo
 ol\, Alexander Dickow. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/ma
