 of Sleep\; "Missing Parts" (Hungary)\, a warrior flees a ritual into a fo
 rgotten world below\; "Habituation" (Sweden)\, a couple travels through a
  country struck by strange weather\; "Flush" (France)\, abominable plumbi
 ng and monstrous deaths beset a building\; "Pigmentosa" (US)\, a terminal
