 ong the city's riverway at sunset. This night features a partial lighting
  around the central basin near Waterplace Park\, just a couple of blocks 
 from the convention hub — a popular diversion before heading to the Eld
 ritch Ball. Free and open to the public. Full listing: https://github.com
 /todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#fri-60
