SUMMARY:🟢 HPLHS's Dark Adventure Radio Theatre: "The Temple"
LOCATION:11 Dorrance Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:The H.P. Lovecraft Historical Society presents a staged perfor
 mance with live accompaniment and audience interaction. As German U-boats
  prowl the North Atlantic during WWI\, a shipwrecked man tells a disturbi
 ng tale of what he experienced aboard a German submarine. Featuring John 
 Softcheck and Liz Stanton\, with live accompaniment by Gary Grundei. Full
  listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2
