SUMMARY:🟠 Late Night Lovecraft featuring Frogman Returns
LOCATION:20 Washington Place\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:The convention's zany late-night tradition of gooey\, slightly
  adult\, insanity-inducing short films\, capped by the bonkers sequel to 
 the cult classic "Frogman." Shorts: "Tasty Encounters" (Austria)\, a hung
 ry man orders a pizza that seems out of this world\; "The Candle" (US)\, 
 a "have your cake...and it eats you" tale\; "Trevor Lies" (US)\, a bizarr
 e tale of a boy and his puritanical family — followed by the feature "F
 rogman Returns" (US)\, in which Frogman is back and brought friends. Full
