DTSTART:20260815T120000Z
DTEND:20260815T133000Z
SUMMARY:🔵 Robert Hayward Barlow: A Life
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:R H Barlow (1918–1951) was more than executor of Lovecraft's
  literary estate — anthropologist\, poet\, publisher\, and sculptor\, w
 ith over one hundred academic publications. Panelists consider his extrao
 rdinary life and legacy. Panelists: Despina Durand (Moderator)\, Peter Ca
 nnon\, Matthew Cheney\, Tim Lonegan\, Ryan Page. Full listing: https://gi
 thub.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#sat-03
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#sat-03
