DTSTART:20260815T120000Z
DTEND:20260815T133000Z
SUMMARY:🔵 The Epistolary Form in Weird Fiction
LOCATION:11 Dorrance Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Found journals and letters\, diaries and ephemera — from Fra
 nkenstein and Dracula to The Call of Cthulhu and House of Leaves\, episto
 lary fiction remains vital to horror. Panelists: Jason A. Wyckoff (Modera
 tor)\, Alison Lanier\, Paula D. Ashe\, Joshua Rex\, Kevin Scott Joiner. F
 ull listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomico
 n-2026/README.md#sat-04
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
