SUMMARY:🔵 A Century of Cthulhu: The Greatest Great Old One
LOCATION:11 Dorrance Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:The Call of Cthulhu was written in the summer of 1926\, right 
 here in Providence. What was it about Cthulhu that captured imaginations 
 for a hundred years and became broadly understood even outside fandom? Pa
 nelists: Kenneth Hite (Moderator)\, Prema Arasu\, Timothy Burall\, Leslie
  S. Klinger\, Will Murray. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blo
 b/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#sat-05
