 , Body Horror and Disability in Lovecraft's Fiction
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Academic paper session chaired by Carlos González. Papers: Ad
 ia Reynolds\, "Hearing Horror: Disability Representation and Lovecraftian
  Horror in the Fiction Podcast Malevolent"\; Benjamin Breyer\, "Cold\, Ci
 rculation\, and Cosmic Affect: Bodily Experience and Sensory Language in 
 Lovecraft's Fiction"\; Bradley Will\, "Rehabilitating Cthulhu and Decodif
 ying Fishpeople"\; Warren Bingcang\, "Fishfolk and Kinsfolk: Trans Resona
