 ero Kane and contemporary horror tales drawing on his personal demons and
  psychiatric training. Panelists discuss his influences and impact. Panel
 ists: Stephen Mark Rainey (Moderator)\, F. Brett Cox\, John Langan\, Jord
 an Douglas Smith\, Douglas E Winter. Full listing: https://github.com/tod
