SUMMARY:🔵 Tales from the Crypt: EC Comics
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:EC Comics specialized in gruesome titles like Vault of Horror 
 and Tales from the Crypt before being scapegoated for juvenile delinquenc
 y in the 1950s. Panelists discuss EC's writers and artists\, its relation
 ship to Pulp Era Weird\, and its enduring legacy. Panelists: David Quiroz
  Jr (Moderator)\, Adam Golaski\, Derek Austin Johnson\, Nicholas Kaufmann
 \, Sarah T Walker. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/l
 ovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#sat-09
