SUMMARY:🔵 36 Sonnets: The Fungi From Yuggoth
LOCATION:11 Dorrance Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Largely written between December 1929 and January 1930\, "Fung
 i From Yuggoth" is one of Lovecraft's most well-known works. Panelists di
 scuss its form\, sources\, themes\, publication history\, and influence. 
 Panelists: Jason Ray Carney (Moderator)\, Prema Arasu\, Adam Bolivar\, Ri
 chard Gerlach\, Justin Woodman. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/tod
 b/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#sat-10
