SUMMARY:🔵 SPECIAL PRESENTATION: Propping Up the Mythos — The Art of C
 reating a Necronomicon\, Revisited
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Since 1997\, Christian Matzke has encouraged fans to create ob
 jects from the Cthulhu Mythos. He reveals the secrets of his most ambitio
 us project — a 1\,000-page Elizabethan Necronomicon — through a multi
 media presentation drawing on over 750 completed pages. Full listing: htt
 ps://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md
 #sun-20
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#sun-20
