SUMMARY:🔵 Monsters in the Closet: Queer Representation in Horror Gaming
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Queer representation in horror has come a long way from early 
 stereotypes as evildoers and outcasts. Panelists discuss how the breadth 
 and depth of queerness can tell incredible\, haunting stories. Panelists:
  Tonya Monteforte (Moderator)\, Shanna Germain\, Alison Lanier\, Christop
 her Smith-Adair. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lov
 ecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#sun-27
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#sun-27
