DTSTART:20260816T180000Z
DTEND:20260816T193000Z
SUMMARY:🔵 Orientalism in HPL
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Orientalism mythologized "The Orient" as lands of ancient civi
 lization and decadence\, deeply tied to colonialism and Western supremacy
 . Panelists discuss Orientalism as it appears in Lovecraft's letters and 
 literature. Panelists: John Langan (Moderator)\, Prema Arasu\, Zack Davis
 son\, Matthew Spencer. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/ma
 in/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/README.md#sun-28
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
 DME.md#sun-28
