SUMMARY:🔵 Weird Film from the Pre-Code Era
LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:The 1934 Hays Code had a devastating impact on Hollywood creat
 ivity. Pre-Code films challenge conventional wisdom about early American 
 cinema's treatment of marginalized groups\, sexuality\, and horror. Panel
 ists: Gwen Callahan (Moderator)\, Matthew Cheney\, Gillian Daniels\, Sony
 a Taaffe. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/
 necronomicon-2026/README.md#sun-29
URL:https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026/REA
