 ysterious tomes\, haunt forbidden archives\, and sometimes employ their k
 nowledge to explore the supernatural for good or ill. Panelists: VJ Stone
 craft (Moderator)\, Jeremy Brett\, Timothy Burall\, Nate Pedersen\, Jess 
 Tucker. Full listing: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/ne
