LOCATION:1 West Exchange Street\, Providence\, RI
DESCRIPTION:Fantastique may have been born in Germany\, but it was polishe
 d in France\, with tropes — vampires\, werewolves\, unspeakable crimes 
 — familiar to modern horror fans. Panelists: Matthew Spencer (Moderator
 )\, Jon Black\, Michael Cisco\, Alexander Dickow\, Eric Williams. Full li
 sting: https://github.com/todb/todb/blob/main/lovecraft/necronomicon-2026
